Error [E0003]: There's nothing inside this `{ }` to show
  --> tests/ui/interp_empty.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     print("{}");
    |            ^^
 Why: Interpolation puts a value into the text, so the braces need a value
 Fix: Put a value inside, like `{name}`, or write `{{}}` for literal braces
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
